<h2 id="swift-40-中的可变数组技巧">Swift 4.0 中的可变数组技巧</h2>

<p>我们可用 Xcode 创建playground 来进行练习</p>

<p><strong>首先创建个数组</strong></p>

<div class="language-swift highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
2
</pre></td><td class="rouge-code"><pre><span class="k">let</span> <span class="nv">array</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="kt">NSMutableArray</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nv">array</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">3</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">4</span> <span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">5</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">6</span><span class="p">])</span>

</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

<p><strong>for in 循环遍历</strong></p>

<div class="language-swift highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
2
3
</pre></td><td class="rouge-code"><pre><span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">x</span> <span class="k">in</span> <span class="n">array</span> <span class="p">{</span>
    <span class="nf">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">x</span><span class="p">)</span>
<span class="p">}</span>
</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

<p>打印</p>

<div class="language-sh highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
</pre></td><td class="rouge-code"><pre>1 2 3 4 5 6
</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

<p><strong>想要扣除第一个元素剩余的元素进行迭代遍历呢？</strong></p>

<div class="language-swift highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
2
3
</pre></td><td class="rouge-code"><pre><span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">x</span> <span class="k">in</span> <span class="n">array</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="nf">dropFirst</span><span class="p">(){</span>
    <span class="nf">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">x</span><span class="p">)</span>
<span class="p">}</span>
</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

<p>打印</p>

<div class="language-sh highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
</pre></td><td class="rouge-code"><pre>2 3 4 5 6
</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

<blockquote>
  <p>dropFirst() 函数参数是可以添加数值的  for x in array.dropFirst(3) 打印:4 5 6.</p>
</blockquote>

<p>有 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">first</code> 的地方基本就有<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">last</code></p>

<p><strong>想要扣除最后 3 个元素以外的元素进行遍历？</strong></p>

<div class="language-swift highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
2
3
</pre></td><td class="rouge-code"><pre><span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">x</span> <span class="k">in</span> <span class="n">array</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="nf">dropLast</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">3</span><span class="p">){</span>
    <span class="nf">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">x</span><span class="p">)</span>
<span class="p">}</span>
</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

<p>打印</p>

<div class="language-sh highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
</pre></td><td class="rouge-code"><pre>1 2 3
</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

